## How we work

We're a small team that cares about getting the details right. A laptop only leaves our workshop when it has passed every test, and a customer question only gets closed when it has actually been answered. If that sounds like the way you like to work, we'd like to hear from you.

What we value:

- **Care.** Every laptop, every order and every customer conversation gets full attention.
- **Honesty.** We describe things as they are — to customers and to each other.
- **Learning.** Hardware changes every year. We learn from every repair, return and review.
- **Ownership.** Small team, real responsibility.

## Areas we hire for

Openings change over time, but these are the kinds of roles we typically look for:

### Refurbishment technicians

Diagnose, repair and upgrade laptops from Dell, HP, Lenovo, Apple and other brands — replacing screens, keyboards, batteries and other components to a high standard. Experience with laptop-level repair is valuable; a methodical mindset is essential.

### Quality control and grading

Run final inspections, measure battery health, and grade cosmetic condition consistently against our published [condition grades](/condition-grades).

### Customer support

Help customers choose the right laptop and look after them after they buy — by phone, WhatsApp and email. Clear communication in English and Hindi (or another Indian language) is a plus.

### Operations and logistics

Keep inventory accurate, pack orders carefully and work with courier partners so laptops arrive safely and on time.

## How to apply

We don't have any open positions listed right now, but we're happy to receive applications for future roles.

Send a short introduction through our [contact page](/contact) — choose the topic **"Something else"** and start your message with "Careers" — telling us:

1. Which area you're interested in.
2. Your relevant experience (or what you'd like to learn).
3. Your city, and whether you can work on-site.

We read every message and will get in touch when a suitable role opens up.

*RenewByte is committed to equal opportunity. We welcome applications from everyone, regardless of gender, religion, caste, disability or background.*
